-- Seed data for public.tachograph_cards.
--
-- Split out of init.sql so it can be regenerated from a running instance
-- without touching the schema: Tools -> Deployment snapshot writes this file
-- (and standalone/data.json) from the current database. Commit both, and the
-- next image ships current data instead of the original July snapshot.
--
-- Only loaded into a fresh database; init.sql skips the seed when the schema
-- already exists, so an existing deployment is never overwritten.

